From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: glebn2 <40612835+glebn2@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] init: treat kccharger as the charger boot mode

The Kyocera bootloader of BALMUDA Phone reports off-mode charging as
androidboot.mode=kccharger. Export it as ro.bootmode=charger: init, the
health HAL and the charger UI all expect that value. Without it a
powered-off phone booted all of Android when plugged in, and matching
kccharger in init alone left the charger UI waiting forever for
bpf.progs_loaded (black screen with the backlight on).
---
 init/property_service.cpp | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/init/property_service.cpp b/init/property_service.cpp
index 89adf33..9ba54c7 100644
--- a/init/property_service.cpp
+++ b/init/property_service.cpp
@@ -1357,6 +1357,10 @@ static void ExportKernelBootProps() {
     };
     for (const auto& prop : prop_map) {
         std::string value = GetProperty(prop.src_prop, prop.default_value);
+        // BALMUDA: the Kyocera bootloader reports off-mode charging as androidboot.mode=kccharger.
+        // init, the health HAL and the charger UI all expect ro.bootmode=charger; with kccharger
+        // init booted all of Android, and the charger waited forever for bpf.progs_loaded.
+        if (std::string(prop.dst_prop) == "ro.bootmode" && value == "kccharger") value = "charger";
         if (value != UNSET) InitPropertySet(prop.dst_prop, value);
     }
 }
